Z||000002||Cooter||03-09-2000||08:35 PM||||Most GM seats use the same mounting pattern on the bottom of the seats. It usually just means swapping you seat tracks for the ones that were on the donor seats.<BR>I just installed a set on 95 camaro seats in my Fiero. The drivers side tracks were fine- just had to grind a little off the outer rear mounting ear. The passenger side had to have the fiero tracks bolted on. THey fit perfect and look like they came in the car.||||reg||1
Z||000003||william_thorniii||03-10-2000||07:12 PM||||Friends,<P>I saw a Honda Del Sol with graphite leather seats today.  Those look very nice.  I imagine that you would need to do some customization to get them in though.  <P>William T. Thorn, III||||reg||14
